{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dive into a non-stop, chaos-fueled roguelike shooter where every second is a fight for survival. Whether you play solo or with friends, prepare for massive enemy waves, powerful evolutions, and stylish customization \u2014 all in a colorful arcade world.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723950/extras/7d729b95ed61e620a147952d2eebd8cc.poster.avif?t=1747122724\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723950/extras/7d729b95ed61e620a147952d2eebd8cc.webm?t=1747122724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723950/extras/7d729b95ed61e620a147952d2eebd8cc.mp4?t=1747122724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SINGLE PLAYER OR 2\u20134 PLAYER ONLINE CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Play alone or team up online with 2\u20134 players! Share the madness, sync your builds, and overwhelm your enemies with the unstoppable force of coordinated chaos.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723950/extras/e86b4ffbb37089bb0a2154bdbf16305f.poster.avif?t=1747122724\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723950/extras/e86b4ffbb37089bb0a2154bdbf16305f.webm?t=1747122724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723950/extras/e86b4ffbb37089bb0a2154bdbf16305f.mp4?t=1747122724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TAKE DOWN EPIC BOSSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Challenge monstrous bosses in explosive arena battles filled with traps, fire, missiles, and pure chaos. Each boss fight is a thrilling test of reflexes and teamwork.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723950/extras/aad99854390ce3c4f1394c476745e30e.poster.avif?t=1747122724\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723950/extras/aad99854390ce3c4f1394c476745e30e.webm?t=1747122724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723950/extras/aad99854390ce3c4f1394c476745e30e.mp4?t=1747122724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE, UPGRADE, AND EVOLVE YOUR ABILITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Craft your own playstyle with a huge range of abilities, then evolve them into their Ultimate form. Meteor showers, blade storms, magnetic fields, and more \u2014 every match gives you new ways to dominate.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723950/extras/42600aacb80b8c9291bd3582541e6fea.poster.avif?t=1747122724\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723950/extras/42600aacb80b8c9291bd3582541e6fea.webm?t=1747122724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723950/extras/42600aacb80b8c9291bd3582541e6fea.mp4?t=1747122724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR HERO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dress up your character with fun hats, unlockable outfits, and expressive gear. Whether you want to look cool, silly, or just different \u2014 it\u2019s your battlefield look.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If you\u2019re excited about intense action, wild builds, and co-op mayhem \u2014 don\u2019t miss out.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Add <strong>Last Survivor: Day on Earth</strong> to your wishlist now to stay updated and be the first to jump in at launch!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3723950?t=1747122724","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3723950?t=1747122724","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723950/93885aff924df82c6a580e68943f0670c7eabc5e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747122724","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723950/93885aff924df82c6a580e68943f0670c7eabc5e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747122724","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dive into a non-stop, chaos-fueled roguelike shooter where every second is a fight for survival. Whether you play solo or with friends, prepare for massive enemy waves, powerful evolutions, and stylish customization \u2014 all in a colorful arcade world.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723950/extras/7d729b95ed61e620a147952d2eebd8cc.poster.avif?t=1747122724\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite